=over

=item C<name>

The tag name to use. Required.

=item C<change>

The change to be tagged, specified as a supported change specification as
described in L<sqitchchanges>. Defaults to the last change in the plan.

=item C<note>

A brief note about the tag.

=item C<planner_name>

