It's modeled on L<Array::AsHash> and L<Hash::MultiValue>, but makes allowances
for finding changes relative to tags.

=head1 Interface

=head2 Constructors

=head3 C<new>

  my $plan = App::Sqitch::Plan::ChangeList->new( @changes );

